        "That became our sound.'"
      ],
      "sub": "An accident became a genre."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Rinse FM.",
        "Founded 1994. Illegal until 2010.",
        "Every first Grime voice",
        "ran through this pirate station."
      ],
      "sub": "Wiley. Dizzee Rascal. Skepta. All started here."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2003.",
        "Dizzee Rascal. 17 years old.",
        "Boy in da Corner.",
        "Mercury Prize."
      ],
      "sub": "Recorded in an East London housing estate. Won Britain's highest music award."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "140BPM.",
        "Metallic synths that cut through walls.",
        "MCs who spit — not rap.",
        "Bass wide and low. Raw piano loops."
      ],
      "sub": "The complete anatomy of Grime in one slide."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
